        <li><strong>Custom Voice Slot Limits on Low-Tier Plans:</strong> The Free tier permits only 3 custom voice slots; Starter permits 10; Creator permits 30. A 6-character cast with 1 alternate backup per role requires 12 slots, meaning you will need the Creator tier ($22/mo) if you keep your full shortlist loaded in your workspace simultaneously.</li>
        <li><strong>Legacy Default Voice Expiration:</strong> Official ElevenLabs documentation explicitly states: <em>"All our Default voices will expire on December 31, 2026, and they will no longer be accessible after this date."</em> Productions intended for multi-year continuity must rely on community voices, custom Voice Design, or cloned voices.</li>
        <li><strong>Audio Tags Feature Status:</strong> ElevenLabs documentation notes that inline audio tags are <em>"still under active development, actual results may vary."</em> While powerful, they are prompt-guided rather than deterministic audio parameters.</li>
        <li><strong>Licensing Constraints on Iconic Celebrity Voices:</strong> Voices like Sir Michael Caine™, Stan Lee™, and Megatron™ have commercial licensing terms that may carry restrictions or higher commercial tier obligations compared to standard community or design voices.</li>
