      <li><strong>Inline Audio Tags:</strong> Granular acting cues wrapped in brackets (e.g., <code>[whispers]</code>, <code>[sarcastically]</code>, <code>[giggles]</code>, <code>[sighs contentedly]</code>, <code>[laughs warmly]</code>) allow you to direct subtext and vocal delivery within the dialogue text itself, rather than relying solely on global sliders.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <strong>Plan Recommendation:</strong> For testing and building a demo, start on the <strong>Starter plan ($6/mo, 30,000 credits)</strong> or <strong>Creator plan ($22/mo, 121,000 credits, first month $11)</strong>. The Free plan ($0/mo, 10,000 credits) is limited to 3 Studio projects and 3 custom voice slots, which cannot hold a 6-character cast simultaneously. Starter includes 20 Studio projects and 10 custom voice slots with commercial rights.
    </p>

